器的Cookie（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"買機票省錢7秘訣7. 貨比三家（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251013/1054461969110798336048316.jpeg/51TzrYFEtVqUJSQQyj0tpVxoyj3Sttbd6RpQw-kaUMM\"/><figcaption>買機票省錢7秘訣7. 貨比三家（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"買機票省錢7秘訣7. 貨比三家（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251013/1054461971442962432095861.jpeg/GyaVsZ4bIEH5pWPwQfbh0pBtpMMxW_CxX4FmLF-BZiw\"/><figcaption>買機票省錢7秘訣7. 貨比三家（01製圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-08T07:59:57.143855+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1396,"images":23,"source":"HK01 深圳","fallback":"none"}}